# Command palette: case transforms (selection, then word under cursor)
open src/t.c
key shift+End
key ctrl+shift+p
type transform to upper
key Return
expect text HELLO WÖRLD\n
key ctrl+shift+p
type transform to title
key Return
expect text Hello Wörld\n
key Down Home
key ctrl+shift+p
type transform to snake
key Return
expect text foo_bar parseHTTPResponse
key End
key ctrl+shift+p
type transform to kebab
key Return
expect text foo_bar parse-http-response
key ctrl+shift+p
type transform to lower
key Return
key Backspace
expect text foo_bar parse-http-respons\n
